  "content": {
    "id": "p16-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Use Euler’s Theorem to find the remainder when:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$7^4$ is divided by 12",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(7,12)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(12)&=12\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)=4,\\\\7^4&\\equiv1\\pmod{12}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$3^8$ is divided by 16",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(3,16)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(16)&=16-8=8,\\\\3^8&\\equiv1\\pmod{16}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$5^{10}$ is divided by 22",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(5,22)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(22)&=22\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac1{11}\\right)=10,\\\\5^{10}&\\equiv1\\pmod{22}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$9^{16}$ is divided by 32",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(9,32)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(32)&=32-16=16,\\\\9^{16}&\\equiv1\\pmod{32}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$5^{21}$ is divided by 33",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(5,33)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(33)&=33\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\left(1-\\frac1{11}\\right)=20,\\\\5^{20}&\\equiv1\\pmod{33},\\\\5^{21}&=5^{20}\\times5,\\\\5^{21}&\\equiv5\\pmod{33}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$7^{19}$ is divided by 54",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7$",
          "worked": "Since $\\gcd(7,54)=1$, Euler’s Theorem applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\phi(54)&=54\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)=18,\\\\7^{18}&\\equiv1\\pmod{54},\\\\7^{19}&=7^{18}\\times7,\\\\7^{19}&\\equiv7\\pmod{54}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $7$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
  },
